---
const pageTitle = 'Make your BF profile | BF GYM Global';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover"/>
<meta name="theme-color" content="#fff8fb"/>
<meta name="description" content="Create a private, on-device BF GYM profile preview with a display name, fitness interest and optional Instagram handle. Preview your non-functional digital member card without creating an online account."/>
<meta name="robots" content="index,follow"/>
<link rel="canonical" href="https://bfgym.netlify.app/join/"/>
<link rel="icon" href="/bf-icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"/>
<link rel="manifest" href="/manifest.webmanifest"/>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Outfit:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<title>{pageTitle}</title>
</head>
<body>
<header class="topbar">
<a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="BF GYM home"><span class="mark">BF<span>.</span></span><span>GYM <b>GLOBAL</b></span></a>
<a class="back" href="/">← Discover</a>
</header>
<main class="wrap">
<div class="heading"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="pinkdot"></span> BF GYM GLOBAL · BEST FITNESS</div><h1>Your vibe.<br/><em>Your fitness.</em> 💗</h1><p>Make a little profile, choose what you enjoy, and see your personalised-looking BF card. No awkward sign-up wall.</p></div>
<div class="disclosure" role="note"><strong><span aria-hidden="true">ⓘ</span> Private profile preview — not an online account.</strong><p>Anyone can try this free preview, but it is saved only in this browser on this device. We do not upload, publish or verify profiles. Your card is a non-valid demonstration, not an active membership, QR pass, or proof of identity. Real registrations are not open yet.</p></div>
<div class="layout">
  <section class="form-card" aria-labelledby="form-title">
    <div class="form-top"><div><span class="mini">01 / GET TO KNOW YOU</span><h2 id="form-title">Make it yours.</h2></div><div class="heartshape" aria-hidden="true">♥</div></div>
    <form id="member-form" autocomplete="off">
      <label for="display-name">What should we call you? <span class="required">*</span></label>
      <input id="display-name" name="display-name" type="text" maxlength="40" required placeholder="Your first name or nickname" autocomplete="nickname"/>
      <p class="helper">Use a nickname if you like. Please don't add medical details or private information.</p>

      <label for="fitness-goal">What are you into?</label>
      <div class="select-wrap"><select id="fitness-goal" name="fitness-goal"><option value="Starting my fitness journey">🌱 Just starting</option><option value="Getting stronger">💪 Strength training</option><option value="Cardio & movement">🏃 Cardio & movement</option><option value="Learning & consistency">✨ Learning & consistency</option></select></div>

      <label for="instagram">Instagram <span class="optional">optional</span></label>
      <div class="input-prefix"><span aria-hidden="true">@</span><input id="instagram" name="instagram" type="text" inputmode="text" maxlength="30" placeholder="yourhandle" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="none" autocomplete="off"/></div>
      <p class="helper">Only a handle, not a password. Leave blank if you prefer. This link appears only on your own preview card.</p>
      <p class="error" id="form-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
      <button class="save-btn" type="submit">Create my private preview <span aria-hidden="true">♥</span></button>
    </form>
    <div class="form-foot"><div class="lock" aria-hidden="true">♡</div><p>No email. No passwords. No server signup. Saved only in this browser, and you can erase it below.</p></div>
    <button id="clear-profile" class="clear-btn" type="button">Erase my local preview</button>
  </section>

  <section class="preview-col" aria-labelledby="card-title">
    <div class="card-frame">
      <div class="preview-head"><span>02 / CARD PREVIEW</span><span class="preview-indicator">♥ Made for you</span></div>
      <div class="member-card" id="member-card">
        <div class="card-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="card-top"><span class="card-logo">BF<span>.</span> GYM <small>GLOBAL</small></span><span class="demo-chip">DEMO ONLY</span></div>
        <div class="card-avatar" id="preview-avatar" aria-hidden="true">♡</div>
        <div class="card-small-label">MY FITNESS VIBE</div>
        <h2 id="preview-name">Your name here</h2>
        <p id="preview-goal">🌱 Starting my fitness journey</p>
        <div class="card-bottom"><span>BF / PERSONAL PREVIEW</span><span>♥ BEST FITNESS</span></div>
      </div>
      <p id="preview-instagram" class="instagram-preview" hidden>Instagram: <a id="instagram-link" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"></a></p>
      <div id="saved-message" class="saved-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
      <div class="next-step"><div><strong>Found your fitness vibe?</strong><p>Now discover the free workout plan that fits.</p></div><a href="/programmes/">Explore plans ↗</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="future"><div class="star" aria-hidden="true">✧</div><div><h3>What about real memberships?</h3><p>A secure online registration system, public profiles, community matching and active cards would need authentication, moderation, age-appropriate safeguards, data protection and private user storage. Those features are not live. This preview is for exploring the design.</p></div></div>
  </section>
</div>
<footer><a href="/">← Back to BF GYM</a><a href="/privacy/">Privacy information</a><a href="/app/membership/">Existing member-card concept</a></footer>
</main>
<script>
  const key = 'bfgym-local-profile-preview-v1';
  const form = document.getElementById('member-form');
  const nameInput = document.getElementById('display-name');
  const goalInput = document.getElementById('fitness-goal');
  const instagramInput = document.getElementById('instagram');
  const error = document.getElementById('form-error');
  const nameOutput = document.getElementById('preview-name');
  const avatarOutput = document.getElementById('preview-avatar');
  const goalOutput = document.getElementById('preview-goal');
  const instaRow = document.getElementById('preview-instagram');
  const instaLink = document.getElementById('instagram-link');
  const status = document.getElementById('saved-message');
  const clear = document.getElementById('clear-profile');
  const validHandle = /^[A-Za-z0-9._]{1,30}$/;
  const goals = ['Starting my fitness journey','Getting stronger','Cardio & movement','Learning & consistency'];
  function cleanInstagram(value) {
    const candidate = value.trim().replace(/^@/,'');
    return candidate;
  }
  function showPreview(profile) {
    const displayName = profile.name || 'Your name here';
    nameOutput.textContent = displayName;
    avatarOutput.textContent = profile.name ? displayName.trim().charAt(0).toUpperCase() : '♡';
    const goal = goals.includes(profile.goal) ? profile.goal : goals[0];
    goalOutput.textContent = '♥ ' + goal;
    const handle = profile.instagram || '';
    if (handle && validHandle.test(handle)) {
      instaRow.hidden = false;
      instaLink.textContent = '@' + handle;
      instaLink.href = 'https://www.instagram.com/' + encodeURIComponent(handle) + '/';
    } else {
      instaRow.hidden = true;
      instaLink.removeAttribute('href');
      instaLink.textContent = '';
    }
  }
  function saveLocal(profile) {
    try { localStorage.setItem(key,JSON.stringify(profile)); return true; } catch (_) { return false; }
  }
  let savedProfile = null;
  try {
    const parsed = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(key) || 'null');
    if (parsed && typeof parsed.name === 'string' && typeof parsed.goal === 'string') savedProfile = parsed;
  } catch (_) {}
  if (savedProfile) {
    nameInput.value = savedProfile.name.slice(0,40);
    goalInput.value = goals.includes(savedProfile.goal) ? savedProfile.goal : goals[0];
    instagramInput.value = (savedProfile.instagram || '').slice(0,30);
    showPreview(savedProfile);
    status.textContent = 'Your previous on-device preview is ready. ♥';
  }
  form.addEventListener('submit',event=>{
    event.preventDefault();
    error.hidden = true;
    const name = nameInput.value.trim().replace(/\s+/g,' ');
    const instagram = cleanInstagram(instagramInput.value);
    if (name.length < 2 || name.length > 40) {
      error.textContent = 'Enter a name or nickname between 2 and 40 characters.';
      error.hidden = false; nameInput.focus(); return;
    }
    if (instagram && !validHandle.test(instagram)) {
      error.textContent = 'Enter an Instagram username with letters, numbers, underscores or periods only (max 30 characters).';
      error.hidden = false; instagramInput.focus(); return;
    }
    const profile = {name,goal:goalInput.value,instagram};
    showPreview(profile);
    const persisted=saveLocal(profile);
    status.textContent = persisted ? 'Your private card preview is ready and saved in this browser. ♥' : 'Your card preview is ready. This browser blocked local storage, so it may not remain after closing.';
    document.getElementById('member-card').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});
  });
  clear.addEventListener('click',()=>{
    try { localStorage.removeItem(key); }catch(_){}
    form.reset();
    showPreview({name:'',goal:goals[0],instagram:''});
    status.textContent = 'Your local profile preview has been cleared.';
    error.hidden = true;
  });
</script>
<style>
:root{--ink:#242029;--muted:#776e7a;--rose:#ef477d;--lavender:#eee5ff;--paper:#fff;--line:#eee5ed;--bg:#fff8fb;--font:'DM Sans',sans-serif;--title:'Outfit','DM Sans',sans-serif}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);font:14px/1.65 var(--font);color:var(--ink)}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}button,input,select{font:inherit}a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #ce2773;outline-offset:3px}p,h1,h2,h3{margin-top:0}h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--title)}.topbar{height:76px;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 max(20px,calc((100vw - 1130px)/2));gap:20px}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font:900 24px var(--title)}.brand b{font-size:10px;color:#938795;letter-spacing:.14em}.mark{font:900 23px var(--title);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:14px;background:#2d2331;color:#fff}.mark span{color:#ff83af}.back{font-weight:800;font-size:12px;color:#835471}.wrap{width:min(1130px,calc(100% - 34px));margin:0 auto}.heading{padding:54px 0 22px;max-width:720px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:850;color:#a15c87;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.pinkdot{height:10px;width:10px;background:#ff679b;display:inline-block;border-radius:50%}h1{font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,74px);line-height:1.01;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:18px 0}h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--rose)}.heading>p{font-size:16px;color:#685f6b;max-width:580px}.disclosure{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e9d4e1;border-left:4px solid #ef5790;padding:16px 20px;border-radius:13px;margin-bottom:26px}.disclosure strong{font-size:13px}.disclosure p{font-size:12px;color:#6e6270;margin:5px 0 0}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:24px;align-items:start}.form-card,.card-frame{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:24px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 8px 35px #753b5610}.form-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}.mini{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.13em;color:#a98098;font-weight:900}.form-top h2{font-size:32px;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:5px 0 25px}.heartshape{font-size:44px;color:#f7a3c2}.form-card form{display:grid;gap:10px}.form-card label{font-weight:800;font-size:13px;margin-top:8px}.required{color:#d82e72}.optional{font-weight:600;color:#9c8a9b;font-size:11px}.form-card input,.form-card select{width:100%;border:1px solid #e6d9e3;background:#fffafd;border-radius:12px;height:48px;padding:0 14px;color:#3d2e3d}.form-card input:focus,.form-card select:focus{border-color:#e75d92}.helper{font-size:11px;color:#9a8797;margin:0 0 8px}.input-prefix{display:flex;align-items:center;border:1px solid #e6d9e3;border-radius:12px;background:#fffafd;overflow:hidden}.input-prefix>span{padding-left:17px;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#a67f98}.input-prefix input{border:0;background:transparent}.save-btn{border:0;background:linear-gradient(110deg,#ed4484,#d642a1);color:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;font-weight:900;margin-top:16px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:13px}.save-btn span{font-size:23px}.form-foot{display:flex;gap:10px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:22px;padding-top:18px}.lock{font-size:25px;color:#e05789}.form-foot p{font-size:11px;color:#857684;margin:0}.clear-btn{background:transparent;color:#95647e;border:0;text-decoration:underline;font-size:11px;font-weight:750;margin:20px 0 0;padding:3px 0}.preview-col{display:grid;gap:20px}.preview-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;color:#8d7989;font-weight:850;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em}.preview-indicator{color:#c83a74}.member-card{position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:310px;background:linear-gradient(130deg,#272032 0%,#633c65 50%,#ed548d 110%);border-radius:22px;padding:27px;margin-top:18px;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 15px 32px #51284a38;isolation:isolate}.card-glow{position:absolute;border:38px solid #ffffff18;aspect-ratio:1;width:330px;border-radius:50%;right:-80px;top:-135px;z-index:0}.card-top,.card-bottom{position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px}.card-logo{font:900 19px var(--title)}.card-logo span{color:#ffa1c4}.card-logo small{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.1em}.demo-chip{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.1em;background:#ffffff3c;border:1px solid #ffffff65;border-radius:30px;padding:5px 10px;font-weight:900}.card-avatar{position:relative;width:70px;height:70px;border-radius:20px;background:#ffffffa3;color:#86415f;display:grid;place-items:center;margin-top:25px;margin-bottom:12px;font:900 38px var(--title)}.card-small-label{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#ffdeed;font-weight:800}.member-card h2{font-size:29px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:2px 0 3px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.member-card p{font-size:12px;color:#f9e0f0;margin-bottom:20px}.card-bottom{border-top:1px solid #ffffff57;padding-top:14px;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em}.instagram-preview{font-size:12px;color:#805f76;margin:13px 0 0}.instagram-preview[hidden]{display:none}.instagram-preview a{color:#cb3675;font-weight:800}.saved-message{font-size:11px;color:#a33c76;margin:14px 0;min-height:20px}.next-step{padding:18px;background:#fff0f7;border:1px solid #f9d6e7;border-radius:14px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.next-step strong{font-size:13px}.next-step p{font-size:11px;color:#805d70;margin:3px 0 0}.next-step a{background:#3b273d;color:#fff;white-space:nowrap;padding:11px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800}.future{display:flex;gap:13px;background:#f5efff;border-radius:16px;padding:21px;border:1px solid #e6d8f6}.star{font-size:34px;color:#9d78cc}.future h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:15px}.future p{margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#756485}footer{display:flex;gap:17px;flex-wrap:wrap;border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:55px;padding:25px 0 50px;font-size:11px;color:#856c83;font-weight:750}footer a:hover{text-decoration:underline}.error{font-size:12px;color:#a9194d;background:#ffebf0;padding:10px;border-radius:8px}.error[hidden]{display:none}@media(max-width:760px){.topbar{height:65px}.heading{padding-top:37px}.heading>p{font-size:14px}.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.form-card,.card-frame{padding:20px}.form-top h2{font-size:28px}.member-card{min-height:300px;padding:22px}.next-step{flex-wrap:wrap}.next-step a{width:100%;text-align:center}.wrap{width:calc(100% - 26px)}.disclosure{padding:15px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}}
</style>